Subject: [PATCH 02/11] sentry/kernel: add seed-based deterministic RNG for DST
 mode

---
 pkg/rand/rand_linux.go                  | 27 ++++++-
 pkg/sentry/fsimpl/devtmpfs/devtmpfs.go  |  5 ++
 pkg/sentry/kernel/dst_rng.go            | 83 +++++++++++++++++++++
 pkg/sentry/kernel/kernel.go             | 98 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 pkg/sentry/syscalls/linux/sys_random.go | 16 ++++
